From 76a1cb6d07592dafcda4ddb0bebb764614a6820d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 14:23:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] mfd: mt6397: add MT6351 interrupt banks and regulator
 cell

Adapt local patch 0010 to four interrupt banks with a distinct domain
size. Preserve the existing two- and three-bank chip paths and the
preceding MT6328 domain correction. Register only the regulator child
needed by this topic. Do not create RTC, keys or sound children.

The E2 identity and register map come from the existing project PMIC
evidence. This draft adds no board node and has no new hardware result.

Unsigned experiment draft; archive identity is non-certifying.
